---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="AI product manager at Datadog. Personal blog on AI ethics, safety, and the impact of AI on society."
	pubDate={new Date()}
>
	<p>
		I'm Capucine — an AI product manager at Datadog, previously at Amazon.
	</p>

	<p>
		At Datadog, I work at the intersection of observability, alerting, and
		AI, on one core question: how to turn massive streams of signals into
		fast, reliable, actionable decisions.
	</p>

	<p>
		Beyond my day job, I'm fascinated by the philosophical questions AI raises
		about society and about our minds. How is it changing the way we work, the
		way we decide, the way we relate to each other? Do we still know how to
		think critically when machines do part of the thinking for us? This blog
		is where I'll try to reason through those questions.
	</p>

	<p>
		Always happy to talk with people working on the future of AI and
		observability — find me on
		<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/capucine-m-a3511385/">LinkedIn</a>.
	</p>

	<p>
		<em
			>Everything I write here reflects my own personal thinking, not the
			views of my employer.</em
		>
	</p>
</Layout>
